    <div class="doc-main">
      <header class="case-hero">
        <h1>Email Marketing Application</h1>
        <p class="meta">Product Design • UX/UI • Frontend</p>
        <p class="lede">
          Worked on an Email Marketing platform with multiple campaign creation flows,
          including AI-assisted editing, template-based editing, and campaign management tools.
          The goal was to make campaign creation faster, more flexible, and easier to manage. Landing page available at <a href="https://marketing.voog.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">marketing.voog.com</a>
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Hero preview -->
      <section class="hero-vertical" aria-label="Featured preview">
        <button
          class="shot-tile ar-21x9"
          data-full="/images/email-marketing/email-marketing-hero.png"
          data-title="Email Marketing platform overview"
          data-cap="<p>Built product features for flexible campaign creation and management.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Multiple editing flows for different user needs.</li>
            <li>AI-assisted template editing and campaign creation.</li>
            <li>Campaign scheduling and automation support.</li>
            <li>Email tracking and management tools.</li>
          </ul>"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/email-marketing/email-marketing-hero.png"
            alt="Email Marketing platform overview"
          >
        </button>
      </section>

      <section id="s-context">
        <h2>Context</h2>
        <p>
          This project focused on building product features for an Email Marketing platform used to
          create, manage, and monitor campaigns. The product needed to support different ways of
          building emails depending on user skill level and campaign type, while keeping the workflow
          clear and efficient.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="s-problem">
        <h2>Problem</h2>
        <p>
          Email campaign creation can quickly become complex when users need different editing modes,
          scheduling options, and visibility into campaign performance. The challenge was to support
          both flexibility and ease of use without making the product feel fragmented or overwhelming.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Multiple creation flows:</strong> users needed different ways to create campaigns depending on their goals and skills.</li>
          <li><strong>Workflow complexity:</strong> campaign setup, editing, scheduling, and tracking needed to feel connected and manageable.</li>
          <li><strong>Scalability:</strong> the interface had to support growing product features while staying consistent.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="s-approach">
        <h2>Approach</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Worked on product flows for creating and managing email campaigns.</li>
          <li>Built features for <strong>AI-assisted email template editing</strong>.</li>
          <li>Supported multiple editing paths, including <strong>template-based</strong> and more guided campaign creation flows.</li>
          <li>Worked on <strong>campaign scheduling</strong>, automation-related workflows, and management tools.</li>
          <li>Contributed to <strong>email tracking functionality, subscribe & unsubscribe flows</strong> and interfaces supporting campaign monitoring.</li>
          <li>Focused on keeping the experience reusable, scalable, and aligned with the broader product system.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="s-outcomes">
        <h2>Outcomes</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Improved flexibility by supporting different campaign creation methods.</li>
          <li>Helped structure workflows for editing, scheduling, and managing campaigns more clearly.</li>
          <li>Contributed to a product experience that balanced feature depth with usability.</li>
          <li>Expanded the platform with tools for campaign automation and tracking.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="s-role">
        <h2>My Role</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Worked on product design and frontend implementation for Email Marketing features.</li>
          <li>Contributed to editing flows, campaign management interfaces, and tracking-related functionality.</li>
          <li>Helped shape scalable UI patterns for a growing product feature set.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <p class="flex-col links-container">
        <a class="btn link-btn" href="/work">
